# The studio needs no configuration: networks and registry addresses live in
# ../chains.json (the single source of truth for the studio, the extension and
# the contract scripts). After editing it, run `npm run chains:sync` at the repo root.
#
# Optional: read a network through your own RPC endpoint on the server (badge
# images and record pages) instead of the public one. The name is
# TALLY_RPC_URL_<CHAIN KEY>, upper-cased, with dashes turned into underscores.
# https only. These are never sent to the browser.
#
# TALLY_RPC_URL_ARC=https://your-provider.example/rpc
# TALLY_RPC_URL_ARC_TESTNET=https://your-provider.example/testnet-rpc
